    },
    {
      "id": "claim_63292ad8e6c047f4affe7606c7be720d",
      "statement": "npm run ingest:dump runs mcp-server/src/ingest/dump.ts, a manual inspection aid (not a test) that re-runs the load, resolve, render, chunk stages per file and writes a .txt of rendered text and a .chunks.json summary (id, section, tokensApprox, 200-char preview) into ${DATA_DIR}/_dump/ for eyeballing what the pipeline produced for a failing page without standing up the embeddings path.",
